// Semantic Call-Graph Builder, Tarjan SCC Fixed-Point Summary Propagation,
// Legality vs. Cost-Model Inliner, Transactional Callsite Cloning, and Post-Inline SROA Cascade (T064 / E15.3).
// Implements SPEC-73 §§1, 4, 8, 9 (AXS-INL-001..005, AXS-INL-013, AXS-INL-020..026, AXS-INL-034, AXS-INL-035):
//   - Multi-kind semantic `CallGraph` (`DISPATCH_DIRECT`, `DISPATCH_CLOSURE`, `DISPATCH_FN_PTR`,
//     `DISPATCH_DYN_TRAIT`, `DISPATCH_FFI_EXTERN`, `DISPATCH_ASYNC_SPAWN`, `DISPATCH_GPU_LAUNCH`) (`AXS-INL-002`)
//   - Deterministic Tarjan `SCC` decomposition & bottom-up reverse topological traversal (`AXS-INL-003`)
//   - Compiler-derived `EffectSummary` (`Pure` vs `Result<T, E>` normal return vs `MayPanic`) & `FunctionEscapeSummary` (`AXS-INL-004`)
//   - Closed-world vs open-world reachability (`REACH_ROOT`, `REACH_INTERNAL`, `REACH_DEAD_ELIMINATED`) & `address_taken_fn` (`AXS-INL-005`)
//   - Two-stage inlining decision engine (`InlineLegality` strictly orthogonal to `CostModel` / `InlineBudget`,
//     `@inline`, `@inline(always)`, `@inline(never)`, bounded recursive `SCC` unrolling) (`AXS-INL-020..023`)
//   - Transactional callsite cloning, left-to-right arg binding, local/drop-flag/capability remapping,
//     and post-inlining `SROA` + `ConstFold` + `SimplifyCFG` + `DCE` cleanup cascade (`AXS-INL-024..026`)
//   - Deterministic `--emit=callgraph` (`callgraph_print`) and `--emit=inline` (`inline_print`) inspection (`AXS-INL-035`)
